{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00207","headline":"百丈山 · 宣宗皇帝","name":"百丈山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大雄真迹枕危峦，梵宇层楼耸万般。\n日月每从肩上过，山河长在掌中看。\n仙峰不间三春秀，灵境何时六月寒？\n更有上方人罕到，暮钟朝磬碧云端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宣宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}